      "updated": 1791410308118,
      "created": 1791410200764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Back of the envelope estimations, I can\ndo. But i would prefer doing them while\nactually building the High Level Design. If\nthat calculation influences the system\nheavily, I ll be doing them. Is that ok with\nyou?",
      "fontSize": 37.421840727761115,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Back of the envelope estimations, I can do. But i would prefer doing them while actually building the High Level Design. If that calculation influences the system heavily, I ll be doing them. Is that ok with you?",
      "autoResize": false,
